f 1998 fallen extremely short of expectations.\",\"url\":\"https://sahistory.org.za/article/history-official-government-hivaids-policy-south-africa\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"248\",\"title\":\"Nelson Mandela and the battle against HIV and AIDS in South Africa\",\"description\":\"By the time Mandela left the office of president, the infection rate had grown to 20 percent, with 500 deaths from HIV and AIDS everyday. Yet there wasn't a ...Missing:  era | Show results with:era\",\"url\":\"https://swasti.org/knowledgebase/blog/nelson-mandela-and-the-battle-against-hiv-and-aids-in-south-africa-pertinent-lessons\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"249\",\"title\":\"The impacts of AIDS movements on the policy responses to HIV ...\",\"description\":\"The Mandela government did not prioritise AIDS and, due in part to a ... AIDS denialism ultimately impeded implementation of progressive HIV/AIDS policies.\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3738204/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"250\",\"title\":\"Nelson Mandela's Public Health Legacy\",\"description\":\"Dec 30, 2013 · HIV/AIDS is notably absent from his achievements as president. In 1994, the rate of HIV infection was doubling every year(link is external and ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.cuimc.columbia.edu/news/nelson-mandelas-public-health-legacy\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"251\",\"title\":\"Mandela joins chorus of criticism against Mbeki's stance on Aids\",\"description\":\"Sep 29, 2000 · He said the government's focus should be on combating Aids through education and treatment, not on debates about its causes. The ground for Mr ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2000/sep/30/nelsonmandela\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"252\",\"title\":\"As World Mourns Mandela, His Role in AIDS Awareness Recalled\",\"description\":\"As World Mourns Mandela, His Role in AIDS Awareness Recalled · South African leader was initially silent on epidemic, but ultimately became influential voice.Missing:  criticism | Show