ela-and-libyan-leader-muammar-gaddafi-in-tripoli-libya-1990/1165390635625672/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"263\",\"title\":\"In 1991, shortly after his release, Nelson Mandela visited Cuba ...\",\"description\":\"Jul 4, 2025 · Mandela's first visit outside South Africa after his release from prison was to Cuba to personally thank Castro and the Cuban people for their ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.facebook.com/arfsBlog/posts/in-1991-shortly-after-his-release-nelson-mandela-visited-cuba-sparking-strong-re/1284425273047716/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"264\",\"title\":\"Mandela, a Loyal Friend of Cuba's Fidel - Havana Times\",\"description\":\"Dec 7, 2013 · Nelson Mandela also had a symbolic relationship with a Latin American country and, in particular, a man, Cuba's Fidel Castro.\",\"url\":\"https://havanatimes.org/features/mandela-a-loyal-friend-of-cubas-fidel/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"265\",\"title\":\"Mandela Claps Back At US For His Ties With Gaddafi, Castro And ...\",\"description\":\"Sep 3, 2025 · On June 21, 1990, Nelson Mandela defended his ties with Gaddafi, Castro, and Arafat during an ABC Nightline interview after his release.\",\"url\":\"https://thekenyatimes.com/latest-kenya-times-news/today-in-history-when-mandela-fired-back-at-us-for-criticizing-his-relationships-with-gaddafi-castro-and-arafat/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"266\",\"title\":\"Mandela the radical | Features | Al Jazeera\",\"description\":\"Dec 6, 2013 · In a speech in 1991 he also singled out the Soviet Union, East Germany and China for special mention, even as the political landscape of ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.aljazeera.com/features/2013/12/6/mandela-the-radical\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"267\",\"title\":\"Nelson Mandela and the USSR: The Russian role in the struggle ...\",\"description\":\"Dec 6, 2013 · During the state visit, Mandela expressed gratitude for the “solidarity of the Russian people in the South African fight against apartheid and ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.rbth.com/world/2013/12/06/nelson_mandela_and_the_ussr_the_russian_role_in_the_struggle_against_ap_31431\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"268\",\"title\":\"SOUTH AFRICA: LIBYAN LEADER MOAMMAR GADHAFI VISIT (2)\",\"description\":\"Jul 21, 2015 · (14 Jun 1999) Natural Sound The Libyan leader Moammar Gadhafi has visited Robben Island where Nelson Mandela was incarcerated.\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yq_dvbbwEgU\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"269\",\"title\":\"Nelson Mandela's Closest Allies - FPIF - Foreign Policy in Focus\",\"description\":\"Dec 23, 2013 · Nelson Mandela refused to ever dilute his ties to his old friends and allies against Apartheid--even if they were unpopular with the West.\",\"url\":\"https://fpif.org/nelson-mandelas-closest-allies/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"270\",\"title\":\"'The last great liberator': Why Mandela made and stayed friends with ...\",\"description\":\"Dec 10, 2013 · The South African leader remained a friend of fellow liberation leaders, even ones who'd been anything but.\",\"url\":\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/news/worldviews/wp/2013/12/10/the-last-great-liberator-why-mandela-made-and-stayed-friends-with-dictators/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"271\",\"title\":\"Nelson Mandela Awards 1960s - 2000s - South African History Online\",\"description\":\"Jul 17, 2020 · Nelson Mandela Awards 1960s - 2000s · 1980: 14 November, Awarded the Jawaharlal Nehru Award for International Understanding, New Delhi, India.\",\"url\":\"https://sahistory.org.za/article/nelson-mandela-awards-1960s-2000s\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"272\",\"title\":\"Tributes, honours and awards - Nelson Mandela Foundation\",\"description\":\"The Nelson Mandela Tributes Database consists of tributes, honours and awards bestowed on the late Mr Nelson Mandela. It includes tributes he received while ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.nelsonmandela.org/tributes1\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"273\",\"title\":\"Over 40 statues of Nelson Mandela around the world: Here's where\",\"description\":\"Jul 18, 2024 · According to The Outlier website, there are at least 40 public statues of Mandela around the world with 19 of those in South Africa.\",\"url\":\"https://www.thesouthafrican.com/news/politics/over-40-statues-of-nelson-mandela-around-the-world-heres-where-birthday-madiba-union-buildings/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"274\",\"title\":\"GALLERY: The world of Mandela Statues - SABC News\",\"description\":\"Jul 13, 2022 · Mandela statues can be found in over 24 places around the world, if not more from Cape Town to Cuba, Washington to Ramallah in Palestine, South Africa to ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.sabcnews.com/sabcnews/hold-for-amgallery-the-world-of-mandela-statues/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"275\",\"title\":\"The Two Mandelas - Jacobin\",\"description\":\"Dec 13, 2013 · While Mandela was certainly a “great historical figure,” too many tributes have been unable to move beyond hagiography.\",\"url\":\"https://jacobin.com/2013/12/the-two-mandelas/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"276\",\"title\":\"Nelson Mandela and Apartheid: 13 Hollywood Portrayals\",\"description\":\"Dec 5, 2013 · Morgan Freeman played then-South African president Mandela, while Matt Damon portrayed Francois Pienaar, captain of South Africa's rugby team.\",\"url\":\"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/gallery/nelson-mandela-apartheid-13-hollywood-576587/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"277\",\"title\":\"Nelson Mandela death: World reaction - BBC News\",\"description\":\"Dec 6, 2013 · People around the world have been reacting to the news that South Africa's first black president and anti-apartheid icon Nelson Mandela has died, aged 95.Missing:  recognition | Show results with:recognition\",\"url\":\"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-africa-25250082\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"278\",\"title\":\"The Enormity of Mandela's Struggle - Atlantic Council\",\"description\":\"Jul 12, 2013 · Hagiography is not merely cloying, it is counterproductive: it promotes deception and