thicsalarms.com/2013/12/07/nelson-mandela-john-brown-and-the-perils-of-hagiography/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"294\",\"title\":\"Nelson Mandela - CultureWatch\",\"description\":\"Dec 6, 2013 · It was not my intention to say anything about this subject, but with so much hagiography and historical revisionism taking place already, even ...\",\"url\":\"https://billmuehlenberg.com/2013/12/06/nelson-mandela/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"295\",\"title\":\"R.W. Johnson · An Unreliable Friend: Nelson Mandela\",\"description\":\"Aug 19, 1999 · In his savage review of Anthony Sampson's Mandela: The Authorised Biography, RW Johnson displayed a contempt for the present Government of South Africa.\",\"url\":\"https://www.lrb.co.uk/the-paper/v21/n16/r.w.-johnson/an-unreliable-friend\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"296\",\"title\":\"The search for a more human face for Nelson Mandela: An urgent task\",\"description\":\"In particular, the article looks at the hagiographical orientation of several reflections on Mandela, cautioning how some of these may have an effect less noble ...Missing:  portrayal criticisms\",\"url\":\"http://www.scielo.org.za/scielo.php?script=sci_arttext\u0026pid=S0259-94222015000100051\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"297\",\"title\":\"How Nelson Mandela Became a Pop-Cultural Icon Through Music\",\"description\":\"May 11, 2023 · One way to tell the story is to begin in July 1983, at Alexandra Palace in north London, where a modestly attended concert was held.Missing:  depictions | Show results with:depictions\",\"url\":\"https://lithub.com/how-nelson-mandela-became-a-pop-cultural-icon-through-music/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"298\",\"title\":\"Nelson Mandela legacy includes lasting mark on pop culture\",\"description\":\"Dec 5, 2013 · Former South African leader Nelson Mandela, who died Thursday at 95, was represented in the pop-culture and entertainment world in numerous ways.\",\"url\":\"https://www.today.com/popculture/nelson-mandela-legacy-includes-las